{"id":"imperativo.decidir.par-impar","lesson":"imperativo.decidir","kind":"resolver","level":"semilla","required":true,"title":[{"type":"text","text":"Even or odd"}],"statement":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Read a whole number and show "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["even","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["odd","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"restriction":[],"hints":[[{"type":"text","text":"Build the partition: what are the two regions? Is there a number that makes you hesitate?"}],[{"type":"text","text":"A number is even if nothing is left over when you share it out in twos. Look at what is left over when sharing in "},{"type":"lesson_link","lesson":"inicio.nombres","text":"lesson 0.2"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],[{"type":"text","text":"The condition compares what is left over with 0."}],[{"type":"code","tokens":[["If","keywordStructured"],[" "],["number","identifier"],[" "],["mod","operator"],[" "],["2","literalNumber"],[" "],["=","operator"],[" "],["0","literalNumber"],[" "],["Then","keywordStructured"]]},{"type":"text","text":" shows "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["even","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":"; otherwise, "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["odd","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":". Close with the variant."}]],"variant":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Show "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["multiple","identifier"],[" "],["of","identifier"],[" "],["3","literalNumber"]]},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["not","operator"],[" "],["a","identifier"],[" "],["multiple","identifier"],[" "],["of","identifier"],[" "],["3","literalNumber"]]},{"type":"text","text":". (With 9: multiple; with 10: not.)"}]}],"explanation":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Hidden cases: 0 is even, 1 is odd and -3 checks negatives. In PseudoLearn, "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["-","operator"],["3","literalNumber"],[" "],["mod","operator"],[" "],["2","literalNumber"]]},{"type":"text","text":" is -1, which is not 0: the solution with "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["=","operator"],[" "],["0","literalNumber"]]},{"type":"text","text":" works; one with "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["=","operator"],[" "],["1","literalNumber"]]},{"type":"text","text":" fails on -3."}]}],"evaluation":{"type":"cases","cases":[{"inputs":["4"],"expected":"even","hidden":false},{"inputs":["7"],"expected":"odd","hidden":false},{"inputs":["0"],"expected":"even","hidden":true},{"inputs":["1"],"expected":"odd","hidden":true},{"inputs":["-3"],"expected":"odd","hidden":true}],"assertions":[],"reference":"Algorithm EvenOdd\n  Define number As Integer;\n  Read number;\n  If number Mod 2 = 0 Then\n    Write \"even\";\n  Else\n    Write \"odd\";\n  EndIf\nEndAlgorithm\n"}}
